    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: "<color=#F09A38><b>THE GOAL</b></color>\nBirds are taking over the runway. Survive <b>4 waves</b> and clear the airport.\n\n<color=#F09A38><b>THE RIGHT GUN</b></color>\nEvery bird needs its own gun. The wrong gun does only <b>10%</b> damage.\n  Gull  \u2014  Pistol\n  Pigeon  \u2014  Assault Rifle\n  Crow  \u2014  Sniper\n  Hawk  \u2014  RPG\n\n<color=#F09A38><b>BETWEEN WAVES</b></color>\nSpend coins from kills in the shop: new guns, medkits and shields.\n\n<color=#F09A38><b>SURVIVE</b></color>\nYou have 3 lives. Hide in shelters, push barricades for cover and watch the crows: they steal pickups."
